# Build artifacts
#
# Only what actually lands *inside* packaging/. The installers do not: both
# build scripts default --output-dir to the repo root (build.py -> ../dist,
# build_windows.py -> ../dist-win), so `dist/`, `dist-win/`, `*.dmg` and
# `*.exe` here matched nothing and a ~200 MB dist-win/ showed up untracked at
# the root. The root .gitignore covers those.
.build/
.cache/

# Resolved dependency locks, regenerated by `venvstacks lock` on every build.
#
# Ignoring these is why a release is not reproducible: nothing in version
# control pins the app's transitive dependencies, so each build takes whatever
# PyPI has. kimi-cli's uv.lock pins anthropic 0.78.0 — what CI tests against —
# while v0.1.41 shipped 1.3.0, a major bump that also replaced httpx with
# httpx2. See "Dependency locks" in README.md for what closing this needs.
requirements/

# Generated wheels (rebuilt on each run)
wheels/*.whl

# macOS
.DS_Store
